 (3, "Two of the sources are natural capacities, grandeur of thought and the vivid portrayal of the passions, and three are rhetorical skills, figures of speech, diction and metaphor, and the composition of the whole; Wikipedia calls the two kinds inborn and acquirable.", ["F40", "F19", "F35"]),
